  "summary": "No advisory committee was convened for MAYZENT (siponimod, NDA209884). The Summary Review states the application was not referred to an Advisory Committee because the drug is not first-in-class, has a safety profile similar to other approved drugs for the indication, an acceptable trial design, and clear efficacy findings; the Medical Review independently confirms an AC meeting was not convened for this NDA. There are therefore no AC-driven linkages to the approval.",
